<title>USA: Bankers Trust NY Corp sets $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust NY Corp sets $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was</p>
<p>priced on Monday, according to lead manager UBS Securities.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANKERS TRUST NEW YORK CORP</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 10/03/01</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 99.54   PAY DATE 04/03/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A2	SPREAD +40 BP     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  YIELD 6.86 PCT    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>UNDERLYING FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
</text>
